<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge unchanged at 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge unchanged at 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge was unchanged at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 4		   Aug 1</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Open			     75.6000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  0.685		   1.495</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
